Subject: [PATCH 2/3] [Kernel][ROCm] Widen split-KV decode gate from gfx12x to
 gfx1x

The split-KV decode path was gated on on_gfx12x(). The same kernel is
correct and faster on RDNA3: validated on gfx1151 and gfx1100 in addition
to gfx1201. Switch the dispatch and the test skipif to on_gfx1x(), which
covers gfx11xx/gfx12xx and excludes gfx10xx.

Also generalize the occupancy note: torch reports WGPs while rocprof
reports CUs on RDNA3 exactly as on RDNA4 (gfx1201: 32 vs 64 CUs;
gfx1100: 42 vs 84 CUs), so 2 * num_sms lands on the true CU count on
both. The kernel itself is unchanged.

